-cong-q2-2026/\" class=\"padTitle\">[AVA Architects tuyển dụng Q2-2026] – Kỹ sư giám sát thi công, Kỹ sư giám sát MEP</a></li>\n<li class=\"thumbnailBox\"><span class=\"inner-box\"><span class=\"postImage\"><a href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/ava-architects-tuyen-dung-phong-hanh-chinh/\"><img width=\"900\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://ava-architects.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ava-tuyen-dung-phong-hanh-chinh-1-900x900.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"ava tuyen dung phong hanh chinh 1\" title=\"[AVA Architects tuyển dụng Q2-2026] Phòng Hành chính - Kế toán nội bộ &amp; Kỹ sư dự toán 5\"></a><a class=\"padCate\" style=\"background-color:#999999\" href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/chuyen-muc/tuyen-dung-ava-architects/\">Tuyển Dụng</a></span></span><span class=\"padDate\">30/03/2026</span><a href=\"https://ava-architects.vn/ava-architects-tuyen-dung-phong-hanh-chinh/\" class=\"padTitle\">[AVA Architects tuyển dụng Q2-2026] Phòng Hành chính – Kế toán nội bộ &amp; Kỹ sư dự toán</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</section>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"blog-share text-center\"><div class=\"is-divider medium\"></div><div class=\"social-icons share-icons share-row relative\"><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/sharer.php?u=https://ava-architects.vn/watec-building-cat-noc/\" data-label=\"Facebook\" onclick=\"window.open(this.href,this.title,'width=500,height=500,top=300px,left=300px'); return false;\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"icon primary button circle tooltip facebook\" title=\"Share on Facebook\" aria-label=\"Share on Facebook\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><i class=\"icon-facebook\"></i></a><a href=\"https://x.com/share?url=https://ava-architects.vn/watec-building-cat-noc/\" onclick=\"window.open(this.href,this.title,'width=500,height=500,top=300px,left=300px'); return false;\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"icon primary button circle tooltip x\" title=\"Share on X\" aria-label=\"Share on X\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><i class=\"icon-x\"></i></a><a href=\"http